d_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/300aa71d/uploads/origins/a2803a20-25b5-4217-ac9e-6567bdcad762?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c7e5ae852f6b342e075f6020595610bd", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/300aa71d/uploads/origins/a2803a20-25b5-4217-ac9e-6567bdcad762?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c7e5ae852f6b342e075f6020595610bd, https://si.imgix.net/300aa71d/uploads/origins/a2803a20-25b5-4217-ac9e-6567bdcad762?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f8403ffa81fa0bad7e9116246462459f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/300aa71d/uploads/origins/a2803a20-25b5-4217-ac9e-6567bdcad762?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ed4cbcc4dc01373ddf4ca7f8d7e41d79 3x"}, "body": "Hi! I am in love with your artwork. Can you draw my OC, Will (The Programmer)?\n\nAs a human being, Will (The Programmer) is both a genius and an anomaly. For reasons no one can explain, he has lacked the capacity for emotion since birth. Joy, anger and sorrow exist in him only as abstract concepts. Years spent in front of screens have made blue-light glasses a part of his identity, as if placing a faint filter between him and the world. He lives alone, works remotely, maintaining a life with no real need for social interaction. Without emotional impulses to guide or disrupt him, his routine is precise, efficient, and almost static. Video games are one of the few ways he attempts to seek emotional stimulation, though he cannot tell whether they truly have any effect. He never cheats. Instead, he approaches games with near-obsessive patience, endlessly dissecting mechanics and refining techniques. To some, his way of playing might seem dull; to Will, it is simply the closest thing to a genuine “experience.” \nIt all changed when he learned about the “undefeatable” final boss of an arcade game from the last century. As he began his investigation, he accidentally resurrected this miraculous, powerful being and made a deal with him. Thus, the programmer started working on building KILL a body to bring him to reality, and KILL would further serve as the programmer’s personal research topic. \n\nI will leave the pose, composition and details to you. Please draw freely! The link included a folder with the programmer’s outfits in other parodies. You may feel free to choose from those as well. Adjustments to the outfits are completely okay. Thanks for your consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1yovsXkESxiJ--qV9MIRbgqRL_-ZorrYg", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 267326, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "角字🌷", "screen_name": "usaTNJ", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2037099349709320192/MkwkxEw2.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1071551436507365377/1628008983/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}], "banned": false, "nc": 128}, {"id": 966535, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "たきび🐙", "screen_name": "bandam33", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1374027427156926466/h9ELJJOu.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/721470269672415232/1748446911/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 160}, {"id": 1178755, "creator": true, "